":"/audio/8a97350e9fb8cc1c83d4.mp3"}},{"text":"검사","meaning":"检查","explanation":"검사：检查。","readings":[{"term":"검사","audio":"/audio/cf57fb29da3118185a06.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17236","senseId":"1","lemma":"검사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"검사","audio":"/audio/cf57fb29da3118185a06.mp3"}},{"text":"결과를","meaning":"结果，结局","explanation":"결과：结果，结局；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"결과","audio":"/audio/109383e344db8ae54a47.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60093","senseId":"1","lemma":"결과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결과를","audio":"/audio/e20c0588cb4a64adcef1.mp3"}},{"text":"보내","meaning":"送，寄","explanation":"보내다：送，寄；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"1","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보내","audio":"/audio/329d1c4c8f4b72901ced.mp3"}},{"text":"드리겠습니다.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）","explanation":"드리다：为别人做某事（-아/어 드리다，谦敬表达）；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"드리다","audio":"/audio/e583f55bf1cfad46331c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59252","senseId":"1","lemma":"드리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드리겠습니다","audio":"/audio/664adee3249917e99529.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"904de91feaff572f","term":"빠르다","zh":"快，快速，迅速","audio":"/audio/904de91feaff572f721f.mp3","entryId":"68755","definition":"某事达成所用的时间短。","pronunciation":["빠르다"]},{"id":"9a01593bc9b02957","term":"시일","zh":"时日","audio":"/audio/9a01593bc9b02957f699.mp3","entryId":"13971","definition":"完成某件事需要的期间或时间。","pronunciation":["시일"]},{"id":"b3378685b76ee79f","term":"내","zh":"内","audio":"/audio/b3378685b76ee79fd0ef.mp3","entryId":"41388","definition":"一定范围里边。","pronunciation":["내ː"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{